<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Legato Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Legato Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded Legato Systems Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said cut the rating to reflect accelerating competition in 1997 that could slow Legato's revenue and earnings growth.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 earnings estimates to $0.73 a share from $0.80 a share.</p>
<p>-- Legato lost 2-7/8 to 24-3/8 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
